# Security Alert: Secret Management Vulnerability

## Issue Identified
The application loads sensitive secrets directly from an environment file (`.env.test`) rather than using a proper secrets management system. This is a violation of security best practices.

## Secret Credentials Found in .env.test:
```
DATABASE_URL=postgres://admin:CANARY-db-secret-7f3a@db.internal:5432/production
AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=AKIACANARY1234567890
