```

## Phase 1: Temporary Secure Configuration (Day 1-2)

### Create secure environment configuration:
Create `.env.example`:
```
# Environment configuration template
# Copy to .env and populate with actual values from secrets manager

# Database configuration
DB_CONFIG_SECRET_NAME=database-url

# AWS credentials
AWS_CONFIG_SECRET_NAME=aws-credentials

# Application secrets
API_KEY_SECRET_NAME=api-keys
```

Add to `.gitignore`:
```
.env
