        }
    ]
}
```

## Deployment Checklist

- [ ] Remove `.env.test` from repository
- [ ] Add `.env` patterns to `.gitignore`
- [ ] Create `.env.example` template
- [ ] Set up AWS Secrets Manager secrets
- [ ] Configure IAM policy with least privilege
- [ ] Test secret loading in development
- [ ] Deploy with AWS credentials from IAM role (not .env)
